        <h2>Sources</h2>
        <ul class="sources">
          <li>The Open Group Base Specifications (POSIX), <a href="https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap03.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Definitions, the Epoch</a> (midnight UTC on January 1, 1970).</li>
