          <li>Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Year_2038_problem" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Year 2038 problem</a> (signed 32-bit overflow at 03:14:07 UTC on 19 January 2038; the 64-bit fix).</li>
        </ul>
